    "title": "Tigo - Live Video Chat&More",
    "description": "Tigo is a real-time chat app that keeps you connected with friends through instant calls. Join our large community and connect instantly. Discover and connect with friends on Tigo.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\ud83d\udcf9 Real-time chat\r\n\ud83d\udcac Instant messaging with translation assistance\r\n\ud83d\udcf8 Beauty camera with filters and effects\r\n\u2705 Verified real users\r\n\r\nPrivacy:\r\n\ud83d\udd12 No photos or recordings allowed\r\n\ud83d\udc64 Chats start blurred for safety\r\n\ud83d\ude45 Report or block inappropriate users\r\n\ud83d\udccd Your location is never fully disclosed\r\n\r\nVisit our website: www.tigo.chat Tigo is dedicated to enhancing your real-time chat experience and we are constantly improving. For any issues or suggestions, contact us at service@tigo.chat. Feel free to reach out!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tigo is a real-time chat app that keeps you connected with friends through instant calls. Join our large community and connect instantly. Discover and connect with friends on Tigo.<br><br>Key Features:<br>\ud83d\udcf9 Real-time chat<br>\ud83d\udcac Instant messaging with translation assistance<br>\ud83d\udcf8 Beauty camera with filters and effects<br>\u2705 Verified real users<br><br>Privacy:<br>\ud83d\udd12 No photos or recordings allowed<br>\ud83d\udc64 Chats start blurred for safety<br>\ud83d\ude45 Report or block inappropriate users<br>\ud83d\udccd Your location is never fully disclosed<br><br>Visit our website: www.tigo.chat Tigo is dedicated to enhancing your real-time chat experience and we are constantly improving. For any issues or suggestions, contact us at service@tigo.chat. Feel free to reach out!",
